define a .srv file 
Format:
int32 a
int32 b
---
int32 sum
(Top is Request, Bottom is Response, separated by ---)


create an "ament_cmake" package.
Must add these to CMakeLists.txt:
find_package(rosidl_default_generators REQUIRED)
rosidl_generate_interfaces(${PROJECT_NAME} "srv/xxx.srv")

Must add these to package.xml:
<build_depend>rosidl_default_generators</build_depend>
<exec_depend>rosidl_default_runtime</exec_depend>
<member_of_group>rosidl_interface_packages</member_of_group>
Testing Tools 
- ros2 interface list: See all interfaces.
- ros2 interface show <name>: See the content (menu) of a specific interface.